{"item_uid": "指考94-history-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "1950年代起，許多產品都強調商標，以球鞋為例，各廠牌都設計明顯的標記。這種現象與下列\n何者的關係最為密切？", "options": {"A": "學校教育", "B": "報紙", "C": "英語", "D": "電視"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 74.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 59.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 84.0, 75.0, 68.0, 54.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "學者指出：某種現象的出現，反映出社會分工的發展，貧富差距逐漸顯著，統治機構也逐漸確\n立，最足以作為判斷歷史進入文明階段的指標。這種現象是指：", "options": {"A": "文字的運用", "B": "宗教的普及", "C": "城市的誕生", "D": "陶器的發明"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 64.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 81.0, 77.0, 72.0, 60.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有一個國際組織，會員國總人口佔世界人口 8%，組織內人民以天主教、伊斯蘭教及佛教為主\n要宗教，經濟活動多元，主要產品包括木柴、石油及電子產品。這是指那一個組織？", "options": {"A": "歐洲聯盟", "B": "北美自由貿易區", "C": "石油輸出國家組織", "D": "東南亞國協"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 73.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 92.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 51.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 87.0, 76.0, 64.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一個王朝的末期，為了抵抗外患，政府必須增加稅收，卻因而引發國內農民的叛亂；為了應付\n農民叛亂，必須再增加軍費，又使農民叛亂擴大。在內外交迫下，首都被農民攻陷。這應是那\n個時期？", "options": {"A": "秦末", "B": "漢末", "C": "唐末", "D": "明末"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 32.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 51.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 51.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [60.0, 34.0, 24.0, 22.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "學者指出：中國歷史上，當國家陷入分裂，或朝廷要鼓吹集權中央、提振皇權時，某部典籍的\n主張往往成為重要依據。這部典籍最可能是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "春秋公羊傳，該書認為人世只有一個王者可以合法統治天下", "B": "尚書，該書記載周公東征統一天下的過程，可強化君主權威", "C": "禮記，該書提倡社會應有等級，所有人都必須奉法遵禮而行", "D": "易經，該書強調天命起伏，應該隨勢而為，才不會違逆天意"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 31.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 41.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 26.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 31.0, "p_high": 41.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [45.0, 32.0, 29.0, 27.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "這個時代的法律並未規定「士庶之別」，但退職的官員回到家鄉之後，多受到民眾尊敬，有移\n風易俗的功能。這最可能是指那一個時代？", "options": {"A": "秦", "B": "漢", "C": "唐", "D": "明"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 24.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 34.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 18.0, "p_value": 33.0, "p_high": 39.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [40.0, 37.0, 34.0, 30.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "這個條約的簽訂改變了長期以來中國與外國人之間經商的習慣和組織，開始了新的貿易制度。\n一夜之間，過去原本舉足輕重的行商遭到削弱。這個條約最可能是指：", "options": {"A": "南京條約", "B": "天津條約", "C": "馬關條約", "D": "辛丑和約"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 53.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 77.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 68.0, 54.0, 39.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一份文獻記錄乾隆年間一群西方人在北京的經歷，提到朝廷禮儀繁重，但使人感受到宗教式的\n肅靜。沒有人在典禮進行時竊竊私語，「這種肅靜莊嚴是東方的特色，歐洲文明還沒有達到這\n點。」這份文獻最可能是由以下何人記錄的？", "options": {"A": "在朝廷任職的耶穌會士", "B": "英國派遣來華的使節", "C": "葡萄牙東印度公司職員", "D": "俄國駐在北京的商人\n- 1 -\n94年指考 第 2 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 64.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 15.0, "B": 79.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 37.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 71.0, 62.0, 55.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "曹操為了軍事需要，實施屯田制；孫吳則大舉派軍進入山區，征討山越；諸葛亮更是數度深入\n西南山區，以致有七擒孟獲的傳說。這三件事的共同背景為何？", "options": {"A": "漢末大亂人口流徙，戶籍掌握不易，各政權都欠缺勞動力", "B": "五胡民族不斷騷擾邊境，成為三國各政權共同的政治困擾", "C": "三國各政權秉持著秦漢以來的帝國思想，都表現出擴張性", "D": "三國各政權都以華夏文化為主軸，有四海一家的共同理想"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 26.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 42.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 11.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [46.0, 34.0, 24.0, 16.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "網站上有人拍賣一塊以滿、漢兩種文字書寫著「崇禎三年奉敕立石」的石碑。對於這塊石碑，\n以下說明何者最為適當？", "options": {"A": "明末鄭成功部隊開設軍屯時樹立的界碑", "B": "清朝初年在台灣建立軍事據點時的遺跡", "C": "這是台灣民主國成立後劃定界址的界碑", "D": "這是古董商為賺取暴利所製成的假古物"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 29.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 20.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 57.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 35.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 30.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [66.0, 38.0, 24.0, 14.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "學者指出：許多「新資料」僅能補充現有的歷史研究，但偶爾會有大批資料出現，足以讓我們\n對某一時期有新的認識。以下那些新資料最可能讓我們對某個時期的歷史有「新的認識」？", "options": {"A": "河南出土的青銅器，足以改變我們對戰國後期歷史的認識", "B": "湖北出土的簡牘，足以改變我們對秦漢時期楚文化的認識", "C": "美國最近解密並公布的檔案，足以改變我們對越戰的看法", "D": "蔣介石日記的公布，足以改變我們對「抗日戰史」的看法"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 14.0, "p_quintiles": [49.0, 40.0, 38.0, 35.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "下列是三段有關台灣法律的資料，請根據日本殖民統治階段的演變，排列其先後順序：\n甲：日本本土法律適用於台灣。\n乙：台灣總督為台灣最高行政長官，有緊急命令權，可不經國會頒布具法律效力之命令。\n丙：總督擁有律令制定權和緊急命令權，但其頒布之命令或律令不得抵觸日本本國法律或\n天皇敕令。", "options": {"A": "甲、乙、丙", "B": "甲、丙、乙", "C": "乙、丙、甲", "D": "丙、乙、甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 53.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 79.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 79.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 68.0, 52.0, 38.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某朝制度上規定地方政府必須向中央申報所轄區域的戶口。該朝中葉時，有部書卻記載：當時\n地方政府按規定申報者不到一半。這部書描述的情況應是那個時期？", "options": {"A": "漢武帝征匈奴之後", "B": "唐代安史亂後", "C": "宋初改革財政之前", "D": "清雍正改革前"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 64.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 83.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 40.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 77.0, 69.0, 56.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "以下資料是從先秦到清代三個不同時期的士人對君主制度的看法：\n甲：「百姓最足珍貴，江山社稷為次，君主要擺在最後。」\n乙：「君主為天下之大害，以前無君主時，人民反可自得其利。」\n丙：「要委屈百姓以伸張君權，要壓抑君主以伸張天道。」\n這三項資料出現的先後順序為何？", "options": {"A": "甲、丙、乙", "B": "乙、丙、甲", "C": "丙、甲、乙", "D": "丙、乙、甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 45.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 69.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 21.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 45.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 59.0, 46.0, 32.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "六朝時期有人指出：平常人家，婦女再嫁，後夫多寵愛前夫遺孤，但是男子再娶，後妻一定虐\n待前妻之子，此現象實是「事勢使然」。所謂「事勢」，最可能反映當時何種社會實況？", "options": {"A": "同父異母子女間的關係較差", "B": "女子改嫁比男子再娶易受社會認同", "C": "繼父比繼母疼愛單親的子女", "D": "家族繼承權以族內同姓男子為主幹\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 94年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 67.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 82.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 76.0, 70.0, 61.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "國民政府統治大陸時期，規定中國、中央、交通及農民銀行發行國幣。下圖是古董商出售的古\n錢，由中國人民銀行於中華民國三十八年發行，我們應如何理解這張錢幣？", "options": {"A": "國民政府為淪陷區所發行之貨幣", "B": "日本為擾亂中國金融發行此貨幣", "C": "中共在其統治區內所發行的貨幣", "D": "汪政權在其統治區內發行的貨幣"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 41.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 38.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 53.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 39.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 41.0, "p_high": 53.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 44.0, 38.0, 34.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "十六世紀中後期，台灣西南部地區出現了一個日本聚落。這個聚落出現的最可能原因是：", "options": {"A": "日本長期和平，以致人口過剩，必須向外移民", "B": "日本缺乏蔗糖，以此地為據點，從事甘蔗種植", "C": "日本入華的僧人，在此地學習，引入中國文化", "D": "日本倭寇當時以此為據點，騷擾中國東南沿海"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 81.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 59.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 86.0, 73.0, 51.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某地曾是宋朝與外族對峙的邊界，元代時因海運發達，開始建立天妃宮，到清代改稱天后宮，\n香火鼎盛。城中還有幾座天主堂，屢次毀於民教衝突，義和團事件中，受創尤深。這是指何地？", "options": {"A": "鹿港", "B": "泉州", "C": "寧波", "D": "天津"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 34.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 47.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 42.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 20.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 34.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [47.0, 33.0, 31.0, 32.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某國在1801年時人口不到九百萬人，到了1851年時，增加一倍。除了數目增加外，結構也有\n重大改變。1801年時只有五分之一的人口居住在城鎮之中；到了1851年，城居人口佔了一半；\n再到1911年時，變成了五分之四。下列那一個國家符合這樣的敘述？", "options": {"A": "英國", "B": "韓國", "C": "土耳其", "D": "義大利"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 47.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 66.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 29.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 21.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 56.0, 45.0, 38.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "日本外務省發表一份聲明指出：維持東亞和平與秩序，乃日本之使命。最近有國家出售軍用飛\n機給中國，並教授飛行技術，也派遣軍事教育顧問，都是擾亂東亞和平，日本特表反對。中國\n如果利用他國排斥日本，日本只有加以反擊。日本發表這份聲明的最可能時間是：", "options": {"A": "1895年日本打敗中國，強迫佔領台灣之後", "B": "1905年日本戰勝俄國，乘機控制東北之後", "C": "1933年日本擴張軍備，退出國際聯盟之後", "D": "1980年代日、美兩國為保障共同利益之際"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 17.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 25.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [78.0, 51.0, 32.0, 20.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "歷代政府為擴大稅收，確保財政收入，會管制部分物資，實施專賣。下列那項物資最早要到唐\n宋時期才成為政府管制的項目？", "options": {"A": "鐵", "B": "鹽", "C": "茶", "D": "絹"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BC", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 17.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 76.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 66.0, 52.0, 36.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一幅圖畫上描繪著人類求知過程的「知識山」，一路逐級而上，分別是語法、數學、邏輯、音\n樂、天文、幾何、修辭，在頂峰則是神學。這種概念最可能出現在：", "options": {"A": "西元前2世紀的耶路撒冷", "B": "西元3世紀的亞歷山卓", "C": "西元13世紀的巴黎", "D": "西元17世紀的阿姆斯特丹"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ABD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 19.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 45.0, 32.0, 21.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "老師介紹俗稱「番仔火」的火柴，其成分為黃磷等化學原料，一摩擦即可引火。幾位同學對其\n名稱的來源熱烈討論，下列何種說法最為可信？", "options": {"A": "名為番仔火，應與蕃薯、蕃麥一樣，源於17世紀的荷蘭及西班牙商人", "B": "17世紀尚無火柴，這名稱應當是18世紀初期的傳教士引進中國及台灣", "C": "18世紀的化學技術還不能製造火柴原料，這應是19世紀西洋商人傳入", "D": "應當是日本殖民者在台灣設廠製造，但使用進口原料，才稱為番仔火\n- 3 -\n94年指考 第 4 頁\n歷史考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 34.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 11.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 15.0, "p_high": 18.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [20.0, 14.0, 13.0, 15.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "下表是美國在2004年針對幾個國家的一項調查所做的統計，這個表的標題最可能是：\n國家 泰國 南韓 越南 新加坡 斯里蘭卡 日本 不丹\n％ 94 23.3 50 42.5 70 71 74", "options": {"A": "女性佔全部就業人口比例", "B": "全國人口的自然年增加率", "C": "主要民族佔全國人口比例", "D": "佛教徒與全國人口之比例"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 71.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 88.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 71.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 52.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 82.0, 74.0, 65.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一篇文章說：「那一年，土耳其人已經攻下了開羅，控制了地中海沿岸許多地方。葡萄牙人剛\n剛在澳門建立商業據點，也開始把火器賣到日本。這時候，歐洲人還紛擾不安，為了儀式的問\n題爭吵不休。英格蘭的國王結第六次婚，他的前幾個妻子，下場都不太好。」這篇文章最適當\n的標題應是：", "options": {"A": "〈十字軍東征見聞錄〉", "B": "〈世人所知的16世紀〉", "C": "〈康熙十五年〉", "D": "〈明治維新紀要〉"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 89.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 45.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 82.0, 72.0, 57.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某次戰爭之後，除了軍隊外，當地部分居民也被迫離開在此地居住上百年的家園，回到自己民\n族主要的居住地。這種情況可能發生在那一場戰爭之後？", "options": {"A": "1871年德國與法國戰爭結束之後，發生於亞爾薩斯地區", "B": "1918年凡爾賽條約簽訂之後，發生於義大利的北部地區", "C": "1945年德國戰敗投降之後，發生於羅馬尼亞及捷克地區", "D": "1945年日本戰敗投降之後，發生於琉球及朝鮮半島地區"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D或CD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 37.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 31.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 27.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 4.0, "p_quintiles": [27.0, 28.0, 28.0, 27.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位畫家，父親原為喀爾文教派律師，為了逃避宗教迫害而逃到德意志地區。稍後又隨母親回\n到家鄉，並接受了羅馬公教洗禮，宗教也成為他繪畫生涯中重要的主題。他曾在一個伯爵家服\n務，並接受正式教育，精通多種語言。21歲時，他獲得當地畫家公會的承認，成為一名正式的\n畫家。這位畫家應當是何人？", "options": {"A": "米開朗基羅(1475-1564)", "B": "魯本斯(1577-1640)", "C": "莫內(1840-1926)", "D": "馬諦斯(1869-1954)"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ABE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 39.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 34.0, "B": 55.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 40.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 55.0, "p_low": 12.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [61.0, 43.0, 30.0, 18.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "有一個國家，其地曾經被亞歷山大大帝、波斯王朝及成吉思汗所征服；19世紀以後，又遭西方\n強權統治；20世紀初，該地重獲獨立，卻內亂不斷。歷史上，這裡是佛教傳教的重要據點，但\n現在居民主要信奉伊斯蘭教，使用波斯語。這是那一個國家？", "options": {"A": "阿富汗", "B": "馬來西亞", "C": "斯里蘭卡", "D": "南斯拉夫"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "DE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 46.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 75.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 20.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 45.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 75.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 60.0, 43.0, 29.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
