{"item_uid": "指考94-history-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "某人回憶道：他出生後，受到甲國統治。到了二十歲時，加入甲國航空隊，卻受到同儕的歧視，\n後來去攻打曾經是他祖國的乙國。不久，甲國戰敗，他又成為乙國國民。這個人的出生地最可\n能是在那裡？", "options": {"A": "科西嘉", "B": "嘉義", "C": "特拉維夫", "D": "加爾各答"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "CDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 48.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 25.0, "p_value": 48.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 63.0, 47.0, 32.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "學者討論一位音樂家，說：「他代表一個時代的巔峰，也代表那個時代的結束。他為教堂服務，\n為貴族服務，他的作品必須講求整齊、理性，而不應表達個人的情感。」這位音樂家是誰？", "options": {"A": "18世紀初的巴哈", "B": "19世紀初的貝多芬", "C": "20世紀初的荀伯格", "D": "20世紀末的伯恩斯坦\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 94年指考\n共 7 頁 歷史考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ABE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 66.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 81.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 49.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [83.0, 76.0, 67.0, 58.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位思想家有感於時局混亂，寫了下列寓言：蝸牛的觸角上分別建有蠻、觸兩個國家，雙方爭\n戰不休，殺得屍橫遍野。依據你的歷史知識，這個寓言應該出現在那部書中？", "options": {"A": "老子", "B": "莊子", "C": "韓非子", "D": "戰國策"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "AC", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 75.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 68.0, 62.0, 56.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "第二次世界大戰中，甲國支持乙國佔領東歐；乙國應丙國要求，對日本宣戰；丙國則同意甲國\n繼續保有香港。甲、乙、丙各是那個國家？ 甲", "options": {"A": "甲：英國；乙：蘇聯；丙：美國", "B": "甲：英國；乙：美國；丙：蘇聯 保有香港 佔領東歐", "C": "甲：美國；乙：蘇聯；丙：英國", "D": "甲：美國；乙：英國；丙：中國 丙\n對日宣戰 乙"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BCE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 77.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 53.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 77.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 53.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 91.0, 83.0, 70.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-history-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "history", "subject_zh": "歷史", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔80分）", "stem": "一位學者表達他對宗教的看法：「宗教也應該與自然法則相吻合。上帝創造了宇宙之後便離開，\n不會再介入其間了。」所以他堅信宇宙從此依照一個固定的機械法則運作。這位學者最可能活\n在下列那一個時期中？", "options": {"A": "10世紀羅馬公教成為歐洲人的主要信仰時", "B": "14世紀許多人提出「以人為本」的思想時", "C": "16世紀許多人質疑教宗權威要改革宗教時", "D": "17世紀科學思想開始萌芽重新認識世界時"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "AE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 66.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 88.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 40.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 80.0, 68.0, 54.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
